sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Worker
  participant S as Signer
  participant TSA as TSA/OCSP
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant Obj as Object Storage
  participant P as Portal Client
  W->>S: POST /sign {artifact_id, content_uri}
  S->>Obj: GET content
  S->>TSA: Timestamp/OCSP verify
  TSA-->>S: tokens/status
  S->>Obj: PUT signed doc
  S->>DB: INSERT audit_event
  W-->>P: SSE deliverable ready
  P->>Web: GET signed URL (ETag)
  P->>Obj: GET download (If-Match)
